{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/onevideo.OVKit\/documentation\/OVKit\/Fullscreen","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Контролы плеера в полноэкранном режиме необходимо задать через делегат менеджера плееров ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/onevideo.OVKit\/documentation\/OVKit\/PlayerManagerDelegate\/fullscreenControls(for:originPlayerView:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":". Эти контролы должны реализовывать протокол ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/onevideo.OVKit\/documentation\/OVKit\/PlayerFullscreenControlsViewProtocol","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", который является небольшим расширением базового протокола контролов ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/onevideo.OVKit\/documentation\/OVKit\/PlayerControlsViewProtocol","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Обертка полноэкранного контроллера","level":2,"anchor":"%D0%9E%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%82%D0%BA%D0%B0-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%8D%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE-%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BD%D1%82%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BB%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B0","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Некоторые приложения требуют, чтобы все показываемые контроллеры наследовались от одного базового класса. По умолчанию OVKit показывает наследника ","type":"text"},{"code":"UIViewController","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Это можно изменить, вернув в методе ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/onevideo.OVKit\/documentation\/OVKit\/PlayerManagerDelegate\/playerView(_:willShowFullscreen:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" экземпляр контроллера-обертки необходимого класса. Возвращаемый контроллер обязан реализовывать протокол ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/onevideo.OVKit\/documentation\/OVKit\/FullscreenViewControllerProtocol","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Контроллер-обертка ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"обязан добавить"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" контент полноэкранного контроллера (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/onevideo.OVKit\/documentation\/OVKit\/FullscreenViewControllerProtocol\/wrapped","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":") как child view controller перед показом на экране и управлять его layout, растянув на максимальный размер. Контроллер-обертка ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"обязан сообщать"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/onevideo.OVKit\/documentation\/OVKit\/FullscreenViewControllerProtocol\/wrapped","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" о всех событиях своего жизненного цикла и предпочтениях внешнего вида, которые не проксируются стандартными механизмами UIKit. Контроллер-обертка должен реализовывать только ту логику, которая необходима для функционирования навигации внутри приложения. На него не стоит добавлять дополнительные ","type":"text"},{"code":"UIView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Пример настройки контроллера-обертки:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"objc","code":["#pragma mark - Life Cycle","","- (void)viewDidLoad {","    [super viewDidLoad];","    ","    [self addChildViewController:self.wrapped];","    [self.view addSubview:self.wrapped.view];","    [self.wrapped didMoveToParentViewController:self];","}","","- (void)viewWillLayoutSubviews {","    [super viewWillLayoutSubviews];","    ","    self.wrapped.view.frame = self.view.bounds;","}","","#pragma mark - Appearance","","- (BOOL)prefersStatusBarHidden {","    return self.wrapped.prefersStatusBarHidden;","}","","- (UIStatusBarAnimation)preferredStatusBarUpdateAnimation {","    return self.wrapped.preferredStatusBarUpdateAnimation;","}","","- (UIStatusBarStyle)preferredStatusBarStyle {","    return self.wrapped.preferredStatusBarStyle;","}","","- (BOOL)prefersHomeIndicatorAutoHidden {","    return self.wrapped.prefersHomeIndicatorAutoHidden;","}","","- (UIInterfaceOrientationMask)supportedInterfaceOrientations {","    return self.wrapped.supportedInterfaceOrientations;","}","","- (UIInterfaceOrientation)preferredInterfaceOrientationForPresentation {","    return self.wrapped.preferredInterfaceOrientationForPresentation;","}","","- (BOOL)shouldAutorotate {","    return self.wrapped.shouldAutorotate;","}","","- (OVKPlayerView *)playerView {","    return self.wrapped.playerView;","}","","- (void)setSupplementaryViewController:(UIViewController<OVKFullscreenSupplementaryController> * _Nullable)controller animated:(BOOL)animated {","    [self.wrapped setSupplementaryViewController:controller animated:animated];","}","","- (enum FullscreenViewControllerVisualStyle)visualStyle {","    return self.wrapped.visualStyle;","}","","- (void)setVisualStyle:(enum FullscreenViewControllerVisualStyle)visualStyle {","    self.wrapped.visualStyle = visualStyle;","}"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OVKit"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Полноэкранный режим"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"Кастомизация полноэкранного просмотра.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/onevideo.OVKit\/documentation\/OVKit"]]},"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Концепты","title":"Концепты","identifiers":["doc:\/\/onevideo.OVKit\/documentation\/OVKit\/Controls","doc:\/\/onevideo.OVKit\/documentation\/OVKit\/Transitions","doc:\/\/onevideo.OVKit\/documentation\/OVKit\/Prefetch","doc:\/\/onevideo.OVKit\/documentation\/OVKit\/BackgroundPlayback","doc:\/\/onevideo.OVKit\/documentation\/OVKit\/Statistics","doc:\/\/onevideo.OVKit\/documentation\/OVKit\/Extras","doc:\/\/onevideo.OVKit\/documentation\/OVKit\/Plugins"],"generated":true}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ovkit\